<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:02.800" end="00:00:06.300" style="s2">Your honor, I swear I didn&#39; steal <br />the tear of the ocean. I was framed.  </p>
<p begin="00:00:06.300" end="00:00:10.800" style="s2">Framed? The pawn shop cameras saw you with <br />the necklace box. [music] I&#39;m so sorry,  </p>
<p begin="00:00:10.800" end="00:00:15.200" style="s2">Izzy. I can&#39;t lie to the court for you. Victoria, <br />what are you saying? You gave me that box.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.000" end="00:00:24.400" style="s2">The pawn receipt [music] signature <br />confirms your guilt. 5 years in prison.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.200" end="00:00:29.200" style="s2">Victoria, why?</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.300" end="00:00:46.300" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.300" end="00:00:50.700" style="s2">My baby, that little moon. Please let me hold her.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.200" end="00:00:59.700" style="s2">There is no baby to hold. I heard her cry. Give <br />her to me. She was premature. It&#39;s a stillborn.  </p>
<p begin="00:01:00.700" end="00:01:02.200" style="s2">No, you&#39;re lying.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.100" end="00:01:13.300" style="s2">A convicted jewel [clears throat] thief. <br />You want to clean out my register?</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.600" end="00:01:21.100" style="s2">Please, I&#39;ll do the dishes, clean <br />the floors. I just need a job.  </p>
<p begin="00:01:21.700" end="00:01:23.600" style="s2">Get off my property, you criminal trash.</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.100" end="00:01:39.800" style="s2">The Edmund royal family is urgently hiring  </p>
<p begin="00:01:39.800" end="00:01:43.300" style="s2">a governess with a child psychology <br />background for the little princess.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.000" end="00:01:58.693" style="s2">To survive.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.793" end="00:02:10.593" style="s2">Next. ID and name. Isabella <br />Miller. Past. All of the head made.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.693" end="00:02:19.693" style="s2">Stop right there. In this palace, <br />you keep your eyes down, ears open,  </p>
<p begin="00:02:19.693" end="00:02:26.393" style="s2">and mouth shut. The royal family has no use <br />for nosy servants. Clear? Crystal clear, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.693" end="00:02:32.793" style="s2">Come on out, your highness.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.993" end="00:02:38.493" style="s2">Look at this yummy candy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.093" end="00:02:43.393" style="s2">I won&#39;t hurt you. Just let me</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.093" end="00:02:54.093" style="s2">[screaming] My hand! She bit a chunk out of <br />me! You psychotic little brat! Silence! Guards,  </p>
<p begin="00:02:54.093" end="00:02:59.193" style="s2">throw this useless woman out. Next candidate, <br />fix this mess or you&#39;re out [music] too.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.193" end="00:03:07.493" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.493" end="00:03:15.093" style="s2">Hush now, my little star. Don&#39;t <br />you cry. The night is dark,  </p>
<p begin="00:03:15.693" end="00:03:24.793" style="s2">but the morning is bright. Rama is <br />right here, always by your side.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.993" end="00:03:36.993" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.993" end="00:03:39.993" style="s2">My baby. Well, well. Look at this.</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.493" end="00:03:48.693" style="s2">It seems our little monster has <br />finally quiet down. [snorts] Such  </p>
<p begin="00:03:48.693" end="00:03:50.793" style="s2">a rare peaceful moment, right, Alexander?</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.293" end="00:04:02.694" style="s2">You look like you&#39;ve seen a ghost, <br />Victoria. Do you know this woman?  </p>
<p begin="00:04:04.294" end="00:04:09.094" style="s2">Know her? Please. I just think she looks <br />far too pathetic to serve the royal family.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.094" end="00:04:15.194" style="s2">[snorts] She reeks of the <br />streets. [music] It&#39;s disgusting.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.194" end="00:04:30.094" style="s2">[sighs and gasps] [snorts] Forgive my appearance, <br />your Highness. I am only here to serve.  </p>
<p begin="00:04:30.894" end="00:04:34.694" style="s2">You are trembling. Are you afraid or <br />hiding something? [music] Neither,  </p>
<p begin="00:04:34.694" end="00:04:38.594" style="s2">your Highness. Just overwhelmed by your presence.</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.994" end="00:04:47.494" style="s2">Send her away, Alexander. We can&#39;t <br />let this kind of trash near Lillian.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.194" end="00:04:58.594" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.894" end="00:05:03.994" style="s2">Let her pass to the final selection. <br />We&#39;ll see what she&#39;s capable [music] of.  </p>
<p begin="00:05:03.994" end="00:05:06.094" style="s2">Alexander, you can&#39;t be serious.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.194" end="00:05:10.094" style="s2">My word is final.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.794" end="00:05:21.794" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.794" end="00:05:23.794" style="s2">How dare [music] you show your filthy face here,  </p>
<p begin="00:05:23.794" end="00:05:32.294" style="s2">you thief. Lillian is my ticket to the throne. <br />You are a convicted criminal. Get the hell out  </p>
<p begin="00:05:32.294" end="00:05:36.794" style="s2">of my palace or I swear [music] I&#39;ll bury you <br />in a cell for the rest of your miserable life.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.894" end="00:05:49.794" style="s2">You ruined my life once, but you won&#39;t take her <br />from me again. I&#39;m not going anywhere. Your Grace,  </p>
<p begin="00:05:49.794" end="00:05:53.194" style="s2">I must speak with you. It&#39;s about <br />that new applicant, Isabella.  </p>
<p begin="00:05:53.894" end="00:06:00.894" style="s2">At this hour, Victoria? She&#39;s just a commoner. But <br />she&#39;s completely feral. I saw her today. She lacks  </p>
<p begin="00:06:00.894" end="00:06:06.095" style="s2">all basic hygiene. I wouldn&#39;t be surprised if she <br />carries some filthy street disease. We cannot risk  </p>
<p begin="00:06:06.096" end="00:06:12.796" style="s2">her infecting the little princess. A disease in <br />my palace? How dare they even let her through  </p>
<p begin="00:06:12.796" end="00:06:17.896" style="s2">the gates? Don&#39;t worry, my dear. I will handle <br />this peasant at the final selection tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.696" end="00:06:28.496" style="s2">So you are the one applying for the <br />royal tutor? Yes, Your Grace. I am  </p>
<p begin="00:06:28.496" end="00:06:33.496" style="s2">fully qualified to help Qualified? You <br />smell like the gutters of the lower city.</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.596" end="00:06:42.396" style="s2">Oops. My hand slipped. Clean <br />it up with your bare hands.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.896" end="00:06:49.196" style="s2">Your Grace, [music] the tea is <br />boiling and the glass is shattered.  </p>
<p begin="00:06:49.196" end="00:06:53.996" style="s2">Did I stutter? Let&#39;s see your true <br />obedience. A tutor must know her place.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.496" end="00:07:05.196" style="s2">Look at her hesitate. How disgusting, like a stray <br />dog begging for scraps. Throw this trash out of my  </p>
<p begin="00:07:05.196" end="00:07:10.296" style="s2">palace. [music] Look at you crawling on the floor, <br />perfect made material, but your dirty peasant  </p>
<p begin="00:07:10.296" end="00:07:14.596" style="s2">blood makes you entirely unfit for royalty. <br />Guards, [music] throw this trash out of my palace.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.696" end="00:07:28.196" style="s2">No, please. Your Grace, I did everything you <br />asked. Give me a chance. I can help the princess.  </p>
<p begin="00:07:28.896" end="00:07:31.896" style="s2">Move, peasant. Keep your filthy mouth shut.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.496" end="00:07:36.196" style="s2">Lillian! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.696" end="00:07:53.996" style="s2">Keep moving. Don&#39;t resist. What the Princess, <br />let go. She&#39;s dirty. [screaming] [laughter]  </p>
<p begin="00:07:53.996" end="00:08:01.996" style="s2">It&#39;s okay. I&#39;m right here. Don&#39;t be <br />afraid. [panting and gasps] Good heavens,  </p>
<p begin="00:08:02.596" end="00:08:04.296" style="s2">the princess is touching a stranger.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.296" end="00:08:13.997" style="s2">Lillian, sweetie, it&#39;s me. Come to Victoria. Don&#39;t <br />let this filthy criminal taint you. Let her go.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.997" end="00:08:22.597" style="s2">Ungrateful little Enough of this circus. <br />[music] Guards, separate them immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.197" end="00:08:32.497" style="s2">Your Highness, what exactly is going on here?  </p>
<p begin="00:08:32.497" end="00:08:36.897" style="s2">Alexander, this mad woman <br />terrified poor Lilian. Silence.</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.097" end="00:08:43.797" style="s2">Alexander, look at this mess. A <br />royal princess throwing a tantrum  </p>
<p begin="00:08:43.797" end="00:08:48.197" style="s2">over a peasant. It is an absolute <br />disgrace. I ordered her thrown out.  </p>
<p begin="00:08:48.697" end="00:08:51.197" style="s2">Are you letting a child&#39;s [music] <br />tantrum dictate our royal protocol?</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.097" end="00:09:02.097" style="s2">From this day forward, [music] she <br />is Lilian&#39;s exclusive governess.  </p>
<p begin="00:09:02.097" end="00:09:05.097" style="s2">What? But Alexander, she&#39;s <br />Have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.097" end="00:09:12.097" style="s2">And no one except me has <br />the authority to fire her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.297" end="00:09:20.097" style="s2">Wait, the guards are leaving. She&#39;s just a <br />commoner with a shady background. Isn&#39;t it  </p>
<p begin="00:09:20.097" end="00:09:27.097" style="s2">too risky, Your Highness? Risky? A fiancee <br />who can&#39;t even sue the five-year-old child,  </p>
<p begin="00:09:28.297" end="00:09:31.497" style="s2">that&#39;s what I call a real risk. I <br />am doing this for the royal family.  </p>
<p begin="00:09:32.897" end="00:09:35.297" style="s2">Then start acting like a <br />mother, not a jealous child.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.997" end="00:09:48.197" style="s2">Follow me and keep quiet. Yes, ma&#39;am.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.797" end="00:10:03.197" style="s2">Give me your hand. You&#39;re <br />bleeding. It&#39;s nothing. I&#39;m fine.  </p>
<p begin="00:10:04.297" end="00:10:06.997" style="s2">The royal family doesn&#39;t owe <br />favors to servants. Hold still.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.197" end="00:10:10.698" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t hurt. Don&#39;t worry, sweetie.</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.698" end="00:10:15.498" style="s2">I&#39;ll clean the tools. Don&#39;t touch anything.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.598" end="00:10:25.098" style="s2">[music] I won&#39;t hurt you to prove you&#39;re mine.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.098" end="00:10:35.798" style="s2">Five years. She hasn&#39;t slept <br />peacefully for five years.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.098" end="00:10:40.998" style="s2">Your Highness. Don&#39;t wake her up.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.398" end="00:10:53.198" style="s2">[snorts] What kind of magic did <br />you use to make her so dependent  </p>
<p begin="00:10:53.198" end="00:10:58.398" style="s2">on you? [gasps] Tell me the <br />truth. Who exactly are you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.598" end="00:11:06.298" style="s2">Keep the palace secured while I&#39;m away. Double  </p>
<p begin="00:11:06.298" end="00:11:08.298" style="s2">the guards on Lillian Sweet. <br />[music] Yes, your Highness.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.498" end="00:11:21.498" style="s2">[music]  </p>
<p begin="00:11:21.498" end="00:11:23.898" style="s2">The king is out. Time to clean house.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.898" end="00:11:32.098" style="s2">And the little star [music] <br />finally found its way home.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.598" end="00:11:41.498" style="s2">His Highness is gone for two days,  </p>
<p begin="00:11:41.498" end="00:11:45.498" style="s2">which means I make the rules here now. <br />Is there something you need, my lady?</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.198" end="00:11:51.498" style="s2">I&#39;m just here to inspect <br />your teaching environment.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.798" end="00:11:55.198" style="s2">Seems a bit messy, don&#39;t you think?</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.198" end="00:12:05.298" style="s2">Oops. My hand slipped. [music] The royal family <br />doesn&#39;t feed useless trash. Since you love  </p>
<p begin="00:12:05.298" end="00:12:09.998" style="s2">crawling on the floor so much, scrub it. [music] <br />Every single drop by hand. If you leave even a  </p>
<p begin="00:12:09.998" end="00:12:13.799" style="s2">single stain, I will have you thrown straight <br />into prison for destroying royal property.  </p>
<p begin="00:12:14.400" end="00:12:21.400" style="s2">No, please, not [music] there. Then get to work, <br />convict. It&#39;s okay, sweetie. I&#39;m right here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.400" end="00:12:29.129" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.129" end="00:12:36.000" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.000" end="00:12:42.400" style="s2">Scrub harder, you filthy peasant. You missed <br />a spot. Look at her, just like a stray dog.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.500" end="00:12:50.300" style="s2">Take your foot off her. Now.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.700" end="00:12:56.000" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I will clean it up immediately.  </p>
<p begin="00:12:57.500" end="00:13:00.800" style="s2">What is the meaning of this? <br />Your Highness, you&#39;re back early.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.800" end="00:13:06.200" style="s2">Get up. Now.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.200" end="00:13:12.700" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.700" end="00:13:16.400" style="s2">Please don&#39;t fire me. I <br />can fix the rug. Alexander,  </p>
<p begin="00:13:16.400" end="00:13:18.700" style="s2">it&#39;s a misunderstanding. She <br />clumsily spilled the ink herself.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.100" end="00:13:24.800" style="s2">I was simply teaching her some basic <br />etiquette, royal rules, you know.  </p>
<p begin="00:13:24.800" end="00:13:27.400" style="s2">Look at her hands. Is this <br />your idea of royal etiquette?  </p>
<p begin="00:13:29.200" end="00:13:32.300" style="s2">She&#39;s just a commoner. She ruined a <br />priceless rug. Save your breath, Victoria.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.700" end="00:13:38.400" style="s2">Your Highness, please. I <br />was just following orders.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.200" end="00:13:43.800" style="s2">Restrain [music] her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.600" end="00:13:53.500" style="s2">No, have mercy. I didn&#39;t mean to. In my <br />palace, anyone who lays a finger on my  </p>
<p begin="00:13:53.500" end="00:13:57.900" style="s2">daughter&#39;s people faces the consequences. <br />Drag her to [music] the courtyard,  </p>
<p begin="00:13:57.900" end="00:14:05.300" style="s2">20 flaps, and banish her from the royal city <br />forever. Lady Victoria, save me! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.500" end="00:14:17.101" style="s2">My hands are dirty, your highness. <br />I&#39;ll ruin your clothes. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.301" end="00:14:27.801" style="s2">Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.601" end="00:14:36.901" style="s2">Your highness, please. My hands are filthy.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.001" end="00:14:42.101" style="s2">You&#39;ll ruin your suit. I <br />don&#39;t care about the suit.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.901" end="00:14:53.501" style="s2">Your highness, this is highly <br />inappropriate. I&#39;m just a commoner.  </p>
<p begin="00:14:53.501" end="00:14:55.801" style="s2">In here, [music] my rules are the only rules.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.201" end="00:15:02.801" style="s2">What is this?</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.401" end="00:15:12.201" style="s2">It&#39;s nothing. Just a clumsy mistake from <br />the past. Who did this to you? Tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.901" end="00:15:16.901" style="s2">I need to get back to Lily <br />and she must be terrified.</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.501" end="00:15:27.301" style="s2">She&#39;s touching her. Filthy commoner.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.401" end="00:15:38.101" style="s2">Pushing her around only draws him <br />closer. She&#39;s playing the victim.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.301" end="00:15:42.701" style="s2">I need to destroy her for good.</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.701" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">My lady shouldn&#39;t be in a place like this.  </p>
<p begin="00:15:50.701" end="00:15:55.601" style="s2">I need finely ground macadamia powder. No <br />smell, no visible pieces. Enough to kill the  </p>
<p begin="00:15:55.601" end="00:15:59.801" style="s2">child. [music] Enough to stop her breathing. The <br />tutor must be holding the spoon when it happens.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.201" end="00:16:07.501" style="s2">Get it into the royal kitchen. It will look <br />like a careless allergy mistake. I already have  </p>
<p begin="00:16:07.501" end="00:16:11.201" style="s2">someone near the pantry. [music] Then Isabella <br />will take the fall for harming the princess.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.603" end="00:16:29.203" style="s2">I promise [music] you, my <br />sweet angel, let on the base of</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.603" end="00:16:35.603" style="s2">I will [music] find the monster <br />who stole you from me. Victoria  </p>
<p begin="00:16:35.603" end="00:16:38.103" style="s2">will pay for every tear you shed. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.503" end="00:16:45.103" style="s2">Come out, princess. It&#39;s filthy in there. Stop  </p>
<p begin="00:16:45.103" end="00:16:47.803" style="s2">acting like a crazy rat. The <br />queen mother will punish us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.302" end="00:16:53.302" style="s2">Get your hands off her. I&#39;m just doing my job. She  </p>
<p begin="00:16:53.302" end="00:16:57.202" style="s2">needs discipline. I am her exclusive [music] <br />tutor appointed by the prince. Get out now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.302" end="00:17:07.502" style="s2">Hey sweetie, it&#39;s too loud out there, isn&#39;t <br />it? Let&#39;s build our own safe [music] place,  </p>
<p begin="00:17:07.503" end="00:17:12.403" style="s2">just you and me. See? The monsters can&#39;t <br />get past our stars. As long as I&#39;m here,  </p>
<p begin="00:17:12.402" end="00:17:13.502" style="s2">no one will ever hurt you again.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.902" end="00:17:23.602" style="s2">Lady Eleanor, I I didn&#39;t see you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.703" end="00:17:31.603" style="s2">You are the first person to make her smile in five <br />years. She just needs patience. Ma&#39;am, to build a  </p>
<p begin="00:17:31.603" end="00:17:35.903" style="s2">better therapy plan, is there any way I can check <br />her adoption medical files from five years ago?  </p>
<p begin="00:17:36.703" end="00:17:40.103" style="s2">Those records are sealed in the East Wing <br />archives. It&#39;s a restricted area with lethal  </p>
