<p begin="00:54:29.327" end="00:54:32.327" style="s2">what are you doing in the restricted corridor <br />at 2:00 a.m.? Auditing the silver inventory.  </p>
<p begin="00:54:32.327" end="00:54:35.527" style="s2">Do I need your permission to do my job, Lucas? <br />No, ma&#39;am. We&#39;ll patrol the west side. Move out.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.927" end="00:54:50.427" style="s2">Come on. Where are the charity hospital records?  </p>
<p begin="00:54:52.327" end="00:54:56.127" style="s2">The whole year is missing. <br />Damned. She destroyed it all.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.627" end="00:55:07.128" style="s2">Confidential transfer, black channel.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.928" end="00:55:19.128" style="s2">Victoria, you signed it. She wasn&#39;t <br />abandoned. You stole my baby.</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.528" end="00:55:24.428" style="s2">You [snorts] traded her life <br />for a crown. You monster.</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.328" end="00:56:00.528" style="s2">Tonight you serve the guests. In that, <br />she is Princess Lillian&#39;s governess,  </p>
<p begin="00:56:00.528" end="00:56:03.128" style="s2">your Grace. I decide what she is in this palace.</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.928" end="00:56:19.128" style="s2">Just a little longer for Lillian.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.828" end="00:56:27.128" style="s2">You already look like a queen.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.628" end="00:56:40.528" style="s2">Where is Isabella? The queen mother <br />reassigned her for the evening.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.229" end="00:56:51.729" style="s2">Watch your hands, servant. My apologies, my lord.</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.130" end="00:57:21.230" style="s2">Don&#39;t, you clumsy peasant. You nearly <br />ruined my dress. She belongs below stairs.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.230" end="00:57:28.030" style="s2">Throw her out. She has <br />embarrassed this house enough.</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.930" end="00:57:34.930" style="s2">[snorts]  </p>
<p begin="00:57:34.930" end="00:57:35.930" style="s2">I can leave on my own.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.930" end="00:57:41.730" style="s2">Stop. Take your hands off her now.</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.930" end="00:57:53.730" style="s2">Your Highness, please. Don&#39;t <br />hide it. You&#39;re bleeding.</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.430" end="00:58:08.130" style="s2">Alexander, she fell on her own.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.630" end="00:58:13.030" style="s2">One more lie and you leave this room.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.630" end="00:58:18.130" style="s2">The Queen Mother will be furious.</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.330" end="00:58:27.930" style="s2">You answer to me, no one else. <br />You kneel for no servant.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.930" end="00:58:36.830" style="s2">I kneel for whoever I choose. You <br />would shame the crown for this woman.  </p>
<p begin="00:58:36.830" end="00:58:38.130" style="s2">The shame is what was done to her.</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.130" end="00:58:45.530" style="s2">Touch her and you answer to me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.530" end="00:58:52.830" style="s2">I am dressed as a servant. Everyone is watching.  </p>
<p begin="00:58:52.830" end="00:58:56.130" style="s2">Let them watch. Isabella, <br />may I have the first dance?</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.830" end="00:59:03.830" style="s2">No more kneeling tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.030" end="00:59:07.230" style="s2">They hate me for standing here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.530" end="00:59:11.630" style="s2">Then let them hate me first.</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.231" end="00:59:16.331" style="s2">I don&#39;t belong in this room. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.731" end="00:59:20.331" style="s2">You belong wherever you choose to stand.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.831" end="00:59:24.431" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.731" end="00:59:30.031" style="s2">Stop apologizing for taking up space. No one <br />in this palace makes [music] you kneel again.  </p>
<p begin="00:59:31.831" end="00:59:35.431" style="s2">My lady, please control yourself. <br />That was supposed to be my dance.  </p>
<p begin="00:59:36.331" end="00:59:49.998" style="s2">You are risking your standing for me. You <br />are worth the risk. [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.998" end="00:59:55.665" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.664" end="00:59:59.631" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.631" end="01:00:00.431" style="s2">This isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.131" end="01:00:11.031" style="s2">Victoria is distracted by her jealousy <br />tonight. I can&#39;t wait anymore.  </p>
<p begin="01:00:12.131" end="01:00:17.931" style="s2">You are risking the prince&#39;s ultimate protection <br />for a hunch. I don&#39;t need protection. I need  </p>
<p begin="01:00:17.931" end="01:00:23.831" style="s2">the original transfer paper Mark is hiding. <br />Do you even know where this scumbag lives?  </p>
<p begin="01:00:25.331" end="01:00:27.331" style="s2">I heard him give his address <br />after he met with Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.631" end="01:00:34.031" style="s2">No address, no key.</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.931" end="01:00:49.131" style="s2">Call the palace switchboard before 4:00. Say <br />the Blue Lantern is out. Miss the call and  </p>
<p begin="01:00:49.131" end="01:00:56.231" style="s2">Lucas gets this [music] address. 2 hours. The Blue <br />Lantern is out. Bring back proof, not a corpse.</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.731" end="01:01:06.531" style="s2">The slums, the perfect place for a <br />rat to hide. Mark&#39;s greed cost me  </p>
<p begin="01:01:06.531" end="01:01:10.931" style="s2">5 years in hell. But tonight, <br />his greed is my only weapon.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.531" end="01:01:15.132" style="s2">Prison taught me one useful trick.</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.132" end="01:01:34.732" style="s2">A gambler never trusts a bank. He <br />keeps his life insurance close.</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.932" end="01:01:42.332" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.932" end="01:02:03.632" style="s2">I paid this week. [groaning] <br />The lady wants the papers.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.932" end="01:02:09.132" style="s2">Then you won&#39;t mind if we look.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.032" end="01:02:16.332" style="s2">Victoria said no guns.</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.932" end="01:02:30.432" style="s2">Put it down.</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.932" end="01:02:35.932" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.932" end="01:02:36.232" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.232" end="01:02:49.432" style="s2">They work for Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.332" end="01:03:12.032" style="s2">He&#39;s doing what?</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.032" end="01:03:27.021" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.021" end="01:03:55.333" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.334" end="01:03:58.234" style="s2">Royal switchboard. The blue lantern is out.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.634" end="01:04:07.734" style="s2">Red lantern emergency.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.034" end="01:04:12.034" style="s2">She used the distress phrase. Take two guards.</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.734" end="01:04:22.334" style="s2">Call the police. He has a gun.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.334" end="01:04:47.134" style="s2">Give us the box and walk away.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.534" end="01:04:50.734" style="s2">Too many people have seen you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.434" end="01:05:04.034" style="s2">Drop the weapon. Police are on the way.  </p>
<p begin="01:05:05.934" end="01:05:12.934" style="s2">Stop, coat. He went that way. Are you <br />hit? No. Mark is wounded at the apartment.</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.834" end="01:05:21.335" style="s2">Eleanor gave me the address. <br />Your distress call led us here.  </p>
<p begin="01:05:21.335" end="01:05:23.135" style="s2">He knows who sent them. Keep him alive.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.735" end="01:05:29.735" style="s2">[gasps]  </p>
<p begin="01:05:29.735" end="01:05:30.935" style="s2">Don&#39;t let Victoria get it.</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.935" end="01:05:48.235" style="s2">It may prove a child was taken from <br />me. Then we preserve it properly.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.935" end="01:05:56.135" style="s2">You use the phrase that saved your life.</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.235" end="01:06:17.235" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.235" end="01:06:19.235" style="s2">It stays with me until I can show it in the light.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.235" end="01:06:38.235" style="s2">She has the agreement. She has the agreement.</p>
<p begin="01:06:42.435" end="01:06:43.635" style="s2">Now I can prove what you did.</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.135" end="01:06:51.235" style="s2">Speak. Mark is alive. The <br />transfer papers are gone.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.435" end="01:06:57.535" style="s2">Gone where? Isabella took them. Palace guards <br />pulled her out before we could get the box.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.635" end="01:07:01.635" style="s2">Then I burn her name before she burns mine.</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.135" end="01:07:09.535" style="s2">Release the prison file, <br />every photograph before dawn.</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.535" end="01:07:19.735" style="s2">They say the princess&#39;s governess is <br />a convicted royal jewel thief. [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.335" end="01:07:23.736" style="s2">She lied her way into the palace.</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.337" end="01:07:37.537" style="s2">I need to see the princess.</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.037" end="01:07:53.537" style="s2">Five years in prison under my roof. <br />I was convicted. I was also framed.  </p>
<p begin="01:07:55.237" end="01:07:57.537" style="s2">Criminals always have a second story. Search her.</p>
<p begin="01:08:04.037" end="01:08:08.637" style="s2">Get that child away from the convict. <br />Don&#39;t frighten her. I will go with you.  </p>
<p begin="01:08:10.636" end="01:08:15.536" style="s2">Stay with Eleanor. I will come back. Alexander <br />trusted you. How could you do this to him?  </p>
<p begin="01:08:16.037" end="01:08:21.137" style="s2">You are terrified of what I found. Take her to <br />the grand hall. The palace will see what she is.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.836" end="01:08:29.236" style="s2">Your Highness, Isabella&#39;s prison <br />record has been leaked. The Queen  </p>
<p begin="01:08:29.236" end="01:08:32.736" style="s2">Mother has seized her. Nobody <br />moves her until I get there.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.836" end="01:08:37.736" style="s2">By emergency order, your Highness <br />is required in your council now.</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.736" end="01:08:55.236" style="s2">Move. You concealed a convicted thief beside the <br />princess. The crown is in crisis. I concealed  </p>
<p begin="01:08:55.236" end="01:09:01.836" style="s2">nothing. I am investigating who framed her. <br />Until this scandal is contained, you stay here.</p>
<p begin="01:09:11.937" end="01:09:13.437" style="s2">Your appointment ends now.</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.236" end="01:09:20.236" style="s2">My past does not make Victoria innocent. <br />Still accusing me without proof.  </p>
<p begin="01:09:22.137" end="01:09:24.638" style="s2">The truth exists. That is why you are afraid.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.138" end="01:09:32.938" style="s2">Isabella Miller is expelled <br />from the Royal City permanently.</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.938" end="01:09:38.909" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.909" end="01:09:44.338" style="s2">[panting]  </p>
<p begin="01:09:44.338" end="01:09:48.238" style="s2">Don&#39;t hurt her. I&#39;m going. Sign <br />the distancing order and this ends.</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.738" end="01:09:54.638" style="s2">I will burn this council down <br />before I sign that. Remove her.</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.638" end="01:10:01.238" style="s2">By nightfall, your daughter won&#39;t even remember  </p>
<p begin="01:10:01.238" end="01:10:06.138" style="s2">your name. Touch her and your <br />crown becomes your coffin.</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.138" end="01:10:21.338" style="s2">Lillian! Take the princess upstairs now.</p>
<p begin="01:10:34.838" end="01:10:39.138" style="s2">You are forbidden from entering <br />the Royal City again. Lillian!</p>
<p begin="01:10:45.538" end="01:10:46.138" style="s2">Still here.</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.438" end="01:11:11.338" style="s2">Royal trespass order. Come quietly. I <br />was thrown out. I am not trespassing.  </p>
<p begin="01:11:12.738" end="01:11:13.638" style="s2">Save it for the station.</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.839" end="01:11:46.839" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:46.839" end="01:11:49.639" style="s2">I&#39;m here. I&#39;m right here. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.839" end="01:12:08.046" style="s2">Enough. You&#39;re coming with us. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.046" end="01:12:22.339" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.339" end="01:12:24.639" style="s2">Come away, darling. That criminal is gone.</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.640" end="01:12:34.940" style="s2">Lillian, don&#39;t be afraid. <br />Lillian, don&#39;t be afraid. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.339" end="01:12:40.739" style="s2">Take her upstairs, now.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.339" end="01:12:57.339" style="s2">Mommy, don&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.939" end="01:13:05.939" style="s2">Lillian. Mommy, mommy, mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.640" end="01:13:14.040" style="s2">Your Highness, the princess just spoke. <br />What did she say? She called Isabella mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.739" end="01:13:21.339" style="s2">Your Highness, [music] you cannot leave.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.939" end="01:13:27.639" style="s2">Try to stop me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.840" end="01:13:42.040" style="s2">She needs me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.840" end="01:13:57.340" style="s2">Step away from her. Your Highness, <br />we were ordered keys now.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.541" end="01:14:02.641" style="s2">Amelia. Mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.141" end="01:14:18.141" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:14:18.141" end="01:14:19.341" style="s2">Open the gate [music] now.</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.840" end="01:14:29.640" style="s2">Mommy, don&#39;t leave me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.641" end="01:14:34.641" style="s2">[laughter and gasps] Never again. I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.141" end="01:14:43.941" style="s2">Isabella, is she yours? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.641" end="01:14:49.541" style="s2">She was stolen from me the <br />night she was born. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.241" end="01:15:10.941" style="s2">If I lose the crown, she loses everything.</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.940" end="01:15:37.842" style="s2">Oh my god, the horse broke <br />loose. It&#39;s going to crash them.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.842" end="01:15:44.442" style="s2">Someone stop it. It&#39;s heading straight <br />for the princess. Draw your weapons,  </p>
<p begin="01:15:44.442" end="01:15:50.742" style="s2">but hold your fire until it&#39;s clear. <br />Isabella, watch out. Get Lillian out of there.</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.342" end="01:16:03.442" style="s2">Move. Everyone get out of my way. I&#39;ll <br />kill anyone who gets in my way. Guards,  </p>
<p begin="01:16:03.442" end="01:16:08.642" style="s2">shoot the damn horse now. We <br />can&#39;t. We might hit the princess.</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.942" end="01:16:17.742" style="s2">No, stop. Don&#39;t you dare touch [music] <br />them. God damn it, I&#39;m too far.</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.142" end="01:16:28.342" style="s2">Mommy, I&#39;m scared. [screaming] Ow, bleed. <br />Look at me, Lillian. Just close your eyes.  </p>
<p begin="01:16:29.542" end="01:16:34.242" style="s2">I won&#39;t let them take you from me again. Not <br />this time. I will protect you with my life.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.842" end="01:16:59.342" style="s2">Baby, don&#39;t look. Close your eyes. Mommy, <br />you&#39;re hurt. Don&#39;t be afraid, my sweet girl.</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.542" end="01:17:05.542" style="s2">Mommy&#39;s right here. I will always protect you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.442" end="01:17:10.042" style="s2">I love you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.542" end="01:17:16.442" style="s2">Mommy, wake up. Please wake up. <br />Call the royal physician. Hurry.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.642" end="01:17:20.142" style="s2">The horse hit her. Somebody help them.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.942" end="01:17:24.342" style="s2">Isabella. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.242" end="01:17:27.042" style="s2">Daddy, save mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.242" end="01:17:31.742" style="s2">Die, you beast.</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.443" end="01:17:40.243" style="s2">Get out of my way.</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.943" end="01:17:46.243" style="s2">Isabella, look at me. Open your eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.743" end="01:17:58.243" style="s2">Don&#39;t you dare die on me. You finally found <br />her. Please, I beg you. Stay with me. Get  </p>
<p begin="01:17:58.243" end="01:18:02.943" style="s2">a doctor now. Bring the best medical team <br />immediately. If she dies, every single one  </p>
<p begin="01:18:02.943" end="01:18:07.243" style="s2">of them goes to the grave with her. Move out of <br />the way. Medics, secure the stretcher. Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.543" end="01:18:12.843" style="s2">Your Highness, her pulse is fading fast. We are <br />losing her. Do whatever it takes. [music] Keep  </p>
<p begin="01:18:12.843" end="01:18:21.243" style="s2">her alive. Careful with her spine. Lift on three. <br />Mommy, wake up. Don&#39;t leave me. You promised to  </p>
<p begin="01:18:21.243" end="01:18:29.543" style="s2">stay with me. Mommy, please. Princess, [music] <br />please let them save her. You have to let go.  </p>
<p begin="01:18:29.543" end="01:18:34.443" style="s2">No, I won&#39;t let them take you. We have to <br />move her to the surgical wing right now.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.043" end="01:18:45.743" style="s2">Lucas, clear the path and lock down the entire <br />palace. Understood? No one steps out of this gate.</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.943" end="01:18:54.343" style="s2">Wait, what is that? It fell from her waistband, <br />Your Highness. Back away. [music] I&#39;ll take it.</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.743" end="01:19:08.843" style="s2">Royal Charity Hospital, infant transfer agreement, <br />5 years ago. Lillian&#39;s adoption date. Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.243" end="01:19:18.843" style="s2">You stole my daughter [music] <br />and framed her mother.</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.143" end="01:19:23.543" style="s2">Oh God. No, no, no, no.  </p>
<p begin="01:19:24.443" end="01:19:28.243" style="s2">Lucas. Yes, Your Highness. Surround the <br />perimeter. No one breathes without my permission.</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.143" end="01:19:40.144" style="s2">Your Highness, I came as soon as I heard. This is <br />just horrifying. How on earth did the stables lose  </p>
<p begin="01:19:40.145" end="01:19:44.645" style="s2">control? That poor horse must have been terrified <br />by the thunder. And Isabella, she just rushed out  </p>
<p begin="01:19:44.645" end="01:19:48.145" style="s2">like a mad woman. I mean, it&#39;s a tragedy, <br />but you can&#39;t blame anyone but the weather.</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.945" end="01:19:56.045" style="s2">Alexander, why are you looking at me <br />like that? Did I say something wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:19:58.645" end="01:20:00.345" style="s2">You&#39;re completely soaked. Let me help you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.245" end="01:20:10.745" style="s2">Alexander, what did you do? Are you crazy?</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.845" end="01:20:18.945" style="s2">Good heavens. What is going on here, Alexander? <br />Have you lost your mind striking your future  </p>
<p begin="01:20:18.945" end="01:20:24.045" style="s2">bride in the hallway like a common thug? You <br />are a prince. Think of the royal dignity.  </p>
<p begin="01:20:25.645" end="01:20:28.145" style="s2">Don&#39;t come near me. What has gotten into you?  </p>
<p begin="01:20:28.145" end="01:20:33.345" style="s2">Stop right there. I demand you to apologize <br />to Victoria immediately. I didn&#39;t do anything.</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.945" end="01:20:43.945" style="s2">You vicious snake. Take a good look <br />at what you did five years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.745" end="01:20:51.345" style="s2">You thought you buried your sins. They <br />just crawled out to drag you to hell.</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.545" end="01:21:05.145" style="s2">My pristine royal bloodline tainted <br />by this criminal. No, it&#39;s a fake.</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.445" end="01:21:12.345" style="s2">Isabella forged this. That dirty <br />thief set this up to frame me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.545" end="01:21:18.645" style="s2">Still lying? Your signature <br />is on the transfer that moved  </p>
<p begin="01:21:18.645" end="01:21:21.145" style="s2">Isabella&#39;s newborn into the royal orphanage.</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.045" end="01:21:30.945" style="s2">You stole her newborn baby and passed that child <br />into my care as an abandoned orphan. No. I didn&#39;t.  </p>
<p begin="01:21:32.345" end="01:21:39.945" style="s2">You lied to this family for five years. You&#39;re a <br />monster. [gasps] Dear God. The future princess is  </p>
<p begin="01:21:39.945" end="01:21:45.646" style="s2">a thief and a child snatcher. She almost killed <br />the little princess. This is a disgrace to the  </p>
<p begin="01:21:45.646" end="01:21:52.746" style="s2">royal family. Your Grace, don&#39;t listen to them. <br />It&#39;s a conspiracy. Don&#39;t touch me, you filth.  </p>
<p begin="01:21:54.646" end="01:22:02.346" style="s2">Alexander, please. Get your hands off me. I <br />deny everything. This is a piece of paper.  </p>
<p begin="01:22:02.346" end="01:22:07.246" style="s2">It proves nothing. You have no proof. What about a <br />living witness and the payment trail on his phone?</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.246" end="01:22:15.546" style="s2">My second team found him alive at 18 Mercer <br />Street. The phone contains transfers to the  </p>
<p begin="01:22:15.546" end="01:22:25.646" style="s2">nurse and the men sent to kill him. Keep her away <br />from me. I&#39;ll tell you everything. [music] [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.646" end="01:22:28.246" style="s2">No. I don&#39;t know this man. It&#39;s a trick.</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.646" end="01:22:33.246" style="s2">Start with who paid you 5 years ago.  </p>
<p begin="01:22:34.646" end="01:22:41.046" style="s2">It&#39;s her. Victoria. She orchestrated everything. <br />5 years ago, she paid me to use my gambling debts  </p>
<p begin="01:22:41.046" end="01:22:46.446" style="s2">to force Isabella to take the fall. Shut your <br />dirty mouth, you filthy rat. I will kill you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.746" end="01:22:57.246" style="s2">Stay back, murderer. She also paid [music] me to <br />bribe the nurse to steal that newborn baby. The  </p>
<p begin="01:22:57.246" end="01:23:02.046" style="s2">bank records are in that phone. Please, protect <br />me. You stole my daughter. [music] You ruined  </p>
<p begin="01:23:02.046" end="01:23:07.346" style="s2">her life. Alexander, listen to me. It&#39;s a setup. <br />Isabella hired him to frame me. The blood on this  </p>
<p begin="01:23:07.346" end="01:23:12.446" style="s2">contract says otherwise. Your lies end tonight. <br />Don&#39;t [music] touch me, you disgusting parasite.</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.146" end="01:23:19.146" style="s2">Oh dear God. A monster. A complete fraud.</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.846" end="01:23:27.446" style="s2">I almost let this filth [music] taint our royal <br />bloodline. Your Grace, you know me. I am a noble.  </p>
<p begin="01:23:27.446" end="01:23:32.346" style="s2">You are a disgrace. Take her out of my sight. <br />Separate them. Guard them. No one harms her  </p>
<p begin="01:23:32.346" end="01:23:37.346" style="s2">before the court hears this. [music] No, you <br />can&#39;t do this to me. I am your future queen.</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.646" end="01:23:43.947" style="s2">Doctor, how is she? Tell me she&#39;s alive.</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.047" end="01:23:52.547" style="s2">Your Highness, Miss Isabella is <br />out of danger. She is stable under  </p>
<p begin="01:23:52.547" end="01:23:54.447" style="s2">observation. [music] She should wake by morning.</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.147" end="01:24:13.447" style="s2">If you came to decide what <br />happens to me, walk away.</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.947" end="01:24:19.047" style="s2">I came to name what I did.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.347" end="01:24:24.347" style="s2">[music] Then start with the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.647" end="01:24:33.547" style="s2">I grabbed you. I cornered you. I threatened <br />you [music] with a dungeon. None of that  </p>
<p begin="01:24:33.547" end="01:24:35.747" style="s2">was protection. It was power used against you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.347" end="01:24:41.447" style="s2">An apology does not give me back those choices.</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.647" end="01:24:47.447" style="s2">I know. I am not asking you to forgive me today.</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.248" end="01:24:56.848" style="s2">I need my name cleared by a court, not by a <br />prince&#39;s promise. A judge will hear it. You  </p>
<p begin="01:24:56.847" end="01:25:01.147" style="s2">speak first. Tell me what survived, nothing <br />else. The agreement, [music] payments, and  </p>
<p begin="01:25:01.147" end="01:25:06.647" style="s2">Mark&#39;s testimony are safe. Victoria and Mark are <br />separated. I will be there. I speak for myself.  </p>
<p begin="01:25:08.547" end="01:25:10.447" style="s2">Not tomorrow. She needs six weeks.</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.047" end="01:25:19.247" style="s2">Then the hearing [music] waits. Justice <br />will not require you to bleed again.</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.047" end="01:25:24.747" style="s2">No guard shadow me unless I ask.</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.847" end="01:25:30.647" style="s2">You choose the distance, [music] but do <br />not mistake distance for indifference.  </p>
<p begin="01:25:31.547" end="01:25:33.347" style="s2">I asked for choice, not abandonment.</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.147" end="01:25:51.148" style="s2">I will walk into that on my own <br />feet and leave with my own name.</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.749" end="01:26:01.149" style="s2">Are you afraid to go back inside?</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.849" end="01:26:08.149" style="s2">I was afraid for five years. <br />Today I speak. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:26:12.449" end="01:26:15.849" style="s2">Rank grants no one the right to <br />judge this case from the throne.  </p>
<p begin="01:26:16.949" end="01:26:21.249" style="s2">I have royal protection. You do not <br />have mine. The engagement is ended.</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.649" end="01:26:33.849" style="s2">The agreement, payments and calls point to <br />the same day and the same buyer. Victoria.</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.149" end="01:26:38.749" style="s2">She paid me to put Isabella&#39;s name <br />on the necklace papers. The nurse  </p>
<p begin="01:26:38.749" end="01:26:40.749" style="s2">took the baby before Isabella could see her. Liar!</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.649" end="01:26:49.049" style="s2">You stole my child then made the world call <br />me a thief. Look at me now. You were nobody.  </p>
<p begin="01:26:49.049" end="01:26:54.849" style="s2">I was born for that crown. I saw the original fool <br />from her clothing. I kept it from Victoria until  </p>
<p begin="01:26:54.849" end="01:26:59.249" style="s2">Lucas secured it. The rest is hers to say. Miss <br />Isabella, the court will hear you if you wish.  </p>
<p begin="01:27:00.949" end="01:27:05.049" style="s2">They took my name then took my child before <br />I could hold her. I ask this court to return  </p>
<p begin="01:27:05.049" end="01:27:10.349" style="s2">the truth to the public record. Isabella&#39;s <br />conviction is vacated. Her name is cleared.  </p>
<p begin="01:27:11.749" end="01:27:17.249" style="s2">Victoria remains in court custody. Sentencing <br />will follow under law. That crown was mine.</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.049" end="01:27:23.549" style="s2">Mommy.</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.249" end="01:27:32.549" style="s2">My name is Isabella [music] and I am her mother.</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.449" end="01:27:47.749" style="s2">I ordered an innocent mother cast out. That order <br />was wrong. The Crown retracts every accusation  </p>
<p begin="01:27:47.749" end="01:27:53.950" style="s2">I repeated against Isabella. No statement <br />repairs what I did. My conduct must change.</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.750" end="01:28:06.150" style="s2">I came before the cameras or <br />after they cleared my name.</p>
<p begin="01:28:10.750" end="01:28:12.850" style="s2">I threw an innocent mother into the storm.</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.250" end="01:28:16.350" style="s2">You made my daughter watch.</p>
<p begin="01:28:21.850" end="01:28:22.850" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.850" end="01:28:29.950" style="s2">I was wrong. I am sorry. A <br />bow is not repayment. I know.</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.350" end="01:28:33.950" style="s2">Then earn it.</p>
<p begin="01:28:36.550" end="01:28:36.850" style="s2">How?</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.450" end="01:28:43.450" style="s2">No one enters her room, changes her food <br />or removes her caregiver without notice.  </p>
<p begin="01:28:44.750" end="01:28:49.050" style="s2">Including me. Trust will be <br />earned where Lillian can see it.</p>
<p begin="01:28:52.150" end="01:28:52.750" style="s2">Mrs. Isabella.</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.950" end="01:28:58.050" style="s2">Still waiting for permission? This <br />time I am waiting for your choice.</p>
<p begin="01:29:17.950" end="01:29:18.950" style="s2">We begin with the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:29:31.950" end="01:29:34.950" style="s2">Long live the princess.</p>
<p begin="01:29:44.950" end="01:29:45.950" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="01:29:45.950" end="01:29:48.350" style="s2">It&#39;s a fairy tale come true.</p>
<p begin="01:29:57.251" end="01:30:00.051" style="s2">You look breathtaking, your Highness. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:03.151" end="01:30:05.251" style="s2">You cleared your name before <br />you ever wore a crown.  </p>
<p begin="01:30:07.251" end="01:30:08.951" style="s2">No jewel gets to define what happened to me.</p>
<p begin="01:30:11.651" end="01:30:15.051" style="s2">[music] The truth is mine. <br />This choice is mine, too.</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.852" end="01:30:26.652" style="s2">You are the most beautiful bride I have ever seen.</p>
<p begin="01:30:28.952" end="01:30:30.152" style="s2">And you are the bravest [music] prince.</p>
<p begin="01:30:35.052" end="01:30:38.152" style="s2">Are you ready to face our people? <br />I have never been more ready.</p>
<p begin="01:30:48.452" end="01:30:54.152" style="s2">Before God and the Kingdom of Edmund, <br />I now officially crowned Lady Isabella  </p>
<p begin="01:30:54.151" end="01:31:00.051" style="s2">as the Princess of Edmund. You survived the <br />darkest night. Now you own [music] the light.  </p>
<p begin="01:31:00.751" end="01:31:02.151" style="s2">And you are my eternal dawn.</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.751" end="01:31:05.951" style="s2">I will protect you forever.</p>
<p begin="01:31:05.952" end="01:31:15.352" style="s2">[music] [applause] Mommy! Mommy! Oh, my sweet <br />angel. Our family complete [music] at last.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
